<title>GERMANY: DHL win Colombia customer service award.</title>
<headline>DHL win Colombia customer service award.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL Worldwide Express said it has won the top customer service award in Colombia.</p>
<p>The global integrator was awarded the National Re-engineering Award by the country's national re-engineering organisation, a statement issued here said.</p>
<p>The award recognised DHL's full commitment to customer service and orientation to client needs, in particular in client communications and staff training, it added. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
